xclip 0.13, https://github.com/astrand/xclip/tree/9aa7090c3b8b437c6489edca32ae43d82e0c1281
Upstream C and headers, with a small __wasm__ input-mode adaptation; GPL-2.0-or-later, see COPYING.
X11/Xmu/Atoms.h is a local two-macro Xlib replacement for libXmu atom helpers.
wasm silent UTF8/PNG CLIPBOARD input delegates ownership to the persistent bridge
because guest musl has no fork; output and explicit foreground mode use upstream X11.
